{
  "id": "LEV.9",
  "number": "9",
  "bookId": "LEV",
  "reference": "Eby'Abalevita 9",
  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha kiro kya munana Musa ayeta Aroni n'abatabani n'abebembezi ba Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agambira Aroni ati, “Okwate ebuguma y'enumi aha rw'ekihongo ky'enyatano y'obufu, n'empaya y'entama y'ekihongo ky'okwokibwa, byombili enzira kamogo, obihonge omu maisho g'Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogambire Abaisiraeli oti, ‘Mukwate empaya y'embuzi aha rw'ekihongo ky'enyatano y'obufu, enyana n'omwana gw'entama, byombili by'omwaka gumoi, enzira kamogo aha rw'ekihongo ky'okwokibwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enumi n'empaya y'entama aha rw'ebihongo by'emilembe, by'okutambira omu maisho g'Omukama, ekihongo ky'emyaka kitabirainwe n'amajuta, aha rw'enshonga kir'eki Omukama naija kubabonekera.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo Musa yaragiire babileta omu maisho g'Eihema ly'Omuterano, enteko yona egob'aho eyemelera omu maisho g'Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa agamba ati, “Eki nikyo kigambo eky'Omukama abahangiire kukora; Omukama arababonekera omu kitinwakye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashuba agambira Aroni ati, “Ija ahali alutare, ohonge ekihongo kyawe ky'enyatano y'obufu n'ekihongo kyawe eky'okwokibwa, oyegilire enyatano, iwe n'abantu. Kandi olete ekihongo ky'abantu obagilire enyatano, nk'okwo Omukama ahangire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo Aroni agoba alutare, aita enyana y'ekihongo ky'enyatano y'obufu eyabaire egizirwe aha rwa wenene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatabani bamuletera obwamba, abwibikamu orukumu abuteka aha mahembe ga alutare, kandi obwamba abushesha aha maguru gayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai ebishaju n'ensigo n'ekiteko ky'eine, ebyarugire aha kihongo ky'enyatano y'obufu abyokeza ahali alutare, nk'okwo Omukama yabaire ahangiire Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyama n'oruhu abyokeza enjai y'orusisira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aita n'ekihongo ky'okwokibwa, abatabani bamuheleza obwamba, abushaimulira alutare kugizingora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamuhereza n'ekihongo ky'okwokibwa akachweka aha kandi, n'omutwe; abyokeza ahali alutare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayogya amara n'ebilenge abyokejanyia n'ekihongo ky'okwokibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ahonga ekihongo ky'abantu, akwata embuzi y'ekihongo ky'enyatano y'obufu eyabaire egizirwe aha rw'abantu, agiita, agihonga aha rw'enyatano y'obufu nk'ekihongo ky'enyatano y'obufu ekya mbere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahonga ekihongo ky'okwokibwa, mara akihonga kuhonderana n'ekiragiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahonga ekihongo ky'emyaka, akiyoraho ekikamato akyokeza ahali alutare, ekihongo ky'okwokibwa ekya bwankya kitabulimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakwo aita enumi n'empaya y'entama, ekitambo ky'ebihongo by'abantu eby'emilembe. Abatabani bamuheleza obwamba, obwamba obwo abushaimulira alutare kugizingora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebishaju by'enumi n'eby'empaya y'entama, ebishaju by'eikira, n'orushaju rw'amara, ensigo, n'ekiteko ky'eine, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "babitungika aha nkoro, babitwara byona alutare. Ebishaju Aroni abyokeza aha alutare, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kyonkai enkoro n'ekirumbu kya bulyo Aroni abichunkeza omu maisho g'Omukama, nk'okwo Musa yabaire aragiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Aroni aimukya emikono ayolekeire abantu abaha omugisha. Kayamazire kuhonga ekihongo ky'enyatano y'obufu n'eky'okwokibwa n'ebihongo by'emilembe, asongoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa na Aroni bataha omw'Ihema ly'Omuterano. Orwo baturukire baha abantu omugisha, N'Omukama omu kitinwakye abonekera abantu bona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuliro guzibuka omu maisho g'Omukama, gwokeza kimoi ekihongo ky'okwokibwa n'ebishaju ahali alutare. Orwo abantu bona baguboine, batamu enduru, bajumara ahansi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
